<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>System runtime · eRPH Pro</title><style>:root{--ink:#172033;--muted:#687386;--blue:#2563eb;--line:#e5eaf2;--canvas:#f7f9fc;--good:#166534;--bad:#b42318}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--canvas);color:var(--ink);font:15px system-ui,sans-serif}.top{height:70px;padding:0 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.top a{color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:42px 24px}.eyebrow{color:var(--blue);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.title{margin:8px 0}.muted{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.card{margin-top:22px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;background:#fff}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.row:last-child{border-bottom:0}.value{font-weight:750}.ok{color:var(--good)}.failed{color:var(--bad)}code{font-size:12px;word-break:break-all}</style></head><body><header class="top"><strong>eRPH Pro · System runtime</strong><a href="{{ route('owner.dashboard') }}">Overview</a></header><main class="main"><span class="eyebrow">connected signals only</span><h1 class="title">System runtime</h1><p class="muted">This page reports only checks currently connected to the application. Queue, scheduler and backup status are intentionally not shown until independently wired and verified.</p><section class="card"><div class="row"><span>Database connectivity</span><span class="value {{ $database }}">{{ $database }}</span></div><div class="row"><span>Cache read/write</span><span class="value {{ $cache }}">{{ $cache }}</span></div><div class="row"><span>Release label</span><code>{{ $release !== '' ? $release : 'not configured' }}</code></div><div class="row"><span>Health